# Java / Quarkus

- Java 21, Quarkus 3, package `io.questshift`. Public JSON fields stay camelCase on session beans.
- Campaign YAML snake_case maps via `@JsonProperty` on `Campaign.Room` only.
- `CommandEvaluator` order: empty → loot → forbidden → regex/examples → soft match. Do not execute the command.
- `LLMService` must keep room `expectedCommandPattern` after parse; `%dev`/`%test` keep `questshift.llm.enabled=false`.
- No native-image flags, no Ollama URLs, no extra JAX-RS paths beyond `GameResource` / `GameSocket`.
- Committed `questshift.llm.api-key` stays `none`. Do not check in `.env` or `application-local.properties`.
- Tests: `*Test.java` surefire (unit + `@QuarkusTest`). `*IT.java` failsafe (`@QuarkusIntegrationTest`). Format with Spotless; PMD and JaCoCo gates on `./mvnw verify`.
- Enable the repo hook with `./.githooks/install`. It runs `./mvnw -Ppre-commit verify` (Spotless, tests, PMD, JaCoCo; skip ITs).
- PRs to `main` must pass `.github/workflows/quality.yml` (`./mvnw verify`).
